## Hints for Future Agents
GitHub Copilot's API requires an Editor-Version header on every request; any new github_copilot/ model entry must reference *copilot_headers or requests fail with 400. Config changes require litellm-proxy.sh restart (recreates the container); secrets come from the macOS Keychain. A post-commit hook autopushes master to origin, so committing on master publishes immediately.

## Codebase Discoveries
litellm-proxy.sh test-copilot hardcodes claude-sonnet-4-6; other models need a direct curl with the LITELLM_MASTER_KEY Keychain secret.

